{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_indigo_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_indigo_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "硬核飲品",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_indigo_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "011794ec692a6da204c2a87b9a288608bc7b1eb0162b6ca05492295a2c367695",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咔嚓咔嚓......\n咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "真羡慕深靛小姐啊，頭髮這麼長，髮質又很好，不管怎麼打理都好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "有嗎？我其實不這麼覺得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "為什麼這麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "之前在海邊的時候，空氣太潮濕，我的頭髮總是濕答答的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "頭請往左稍微偏一點——好啦，保持這個姿勢不要動哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哢嚓哢嚓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "......來到羅德島之後，頭髮倒是不會濕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "可這幾天，空氣突然變得乾燥了，打理頭髮也變得麻煩起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "應該是羅德島行駛到某些乾旱區域了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咔嚓咔嚓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "是這樣嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "嗯......應該是這樣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "就因為空氣太乾燥，我的頭髮都開始起靜電了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哢嚓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "連深靛小姐這麼漂亮的頭髮都開始起靜電了？很嚴重嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "讓我想想......大概是早上梳頭的時候頭髮就像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "就像？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "讓我想個比較像的東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "就像D32鋼一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "有的時候，短一點的頭髮還會像RMA70-12那樣直立起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我的頭髮又起靜電了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "呃，不，這倒不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "——但是我從來都不知道，原來深靛小姐頭髮的靜電問題這麼嚴重！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "靜電對髮質的損傷是很大的，我自己在這上面吃過好多虧！這種問題可不能視而不見，一定要好好處理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "唔......真的有這麼可怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "短時間倒不會有太大問題，但一直這麼下去，頭髮會變得更乾燥，斷髮和掉髮的問題也會變嚴重的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "而且深靛小姐，你是伊比利亞人，你還說自己以前住在海邊，頭髮總是濕答答的，對吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "那就更不能不管啦。你的頭髮已經適應了潮濕環境，突然來到乾燥地區，受到的傷害會比其他人更大的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我推薦深靛小姐試試這款後勤部開發的抗靜電髮膜，保濕的效果很好，也適合深靛小姐偏乾的髮質。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "唔......好香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "這個要多少錢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不要錢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "這是試用裝，你先拿回去用，如果覺得效果還不錯，就去後勤部申請，他們會給你免費發正式裝的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "藍毒，還有格勞克斯？你們好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你們好，小深靛，還有澄閃小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "啊，藍毒小姐......還有格勞克斯小姐，你們好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "考慮到小深靛理髮可能還要花點時間，我們來給你送點吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "謝謝你們啦。正好我頭髮剛剛剪好，吃點東西再做養護。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "澄閃要來吃一點嗎？藍毒做的點心很好吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我......我是很想嘗嘗藍毒小姐的手藝，可這個，這個湖藍色的蛋糕坯，到底是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "不要緊，製作過程一點都不複雜，染色只用了一種東西哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "一種？可這種湖藍色......真的有什麼食物能給麵團染上這種顏色嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "大概是某種不太常見的素材，不能一次性吃太多的那種。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "欸——欸？！難道是，難道是——不對，不是這個顏色的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "難道是我聞所未聞的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "抱歉抱歉，玩笑開得稍大了一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "不是澄閃你想像中那些恐怖的東西，很平常的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "可用來給麵團染色的，到底是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "是食用色素哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "——色素？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "當然啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "藍毒對甜品的顏色很有講究，如果一般的材料沒法實現她的想法，就只能依靠食用色素啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我還在想，有什麼果實能給麵團染上這種顏色......結果只能想到一些有毒的東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "那，藍毒小姐，我嘗一塊這個蛋糕，可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我不客氣啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "（咀嚼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "（兩眼放光）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我能再吃一塊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "當然了，沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "這裡還有飲料。對，玫紅色的這個，搭配甜品很不錯的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "欸？發生什麼了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "看起來是停電了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我出去看看情況，檢查一下線路。你們先不要動，我馬上回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "怎麼會突然停電了呢？難道是我又沒能控制好靜電？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我覺得不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "你剛剛給我理髮的時候，我一次都沒被電到過，所以應該不是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "啊......其實還是電到過一次的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "有嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "說到靜電，會不會是因為屋裡的某個電器短路了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "也說不定——對了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "來電了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "是小深靛的源石技藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "確實和平時的燈光不太一樣，感覺色調很不一樣，好溫暖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不過，這樣對深靛小姐來說負擔不會太大嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "沒問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "如果因為施術覺得體力不支，隨時可以來我這裡補充糖分和水分哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我以前可是燈塔看守人，就算沒有設備，這點光照也不過是小菜一碟，不用擔心我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我幫你們照明，你們看看房間裡有沒有出故障的電器吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "那就麻煩深靛小姐了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "讓我看看，吹風機、推子、加熱器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "這邊是熱水器、電視機......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "藍毒，我喝點飲料可以嗎，有點口渴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "喝吧，記得喝玫紅色的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "那我不客氣啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "燙髮機......沒有更多電器了，這邊一切正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我這邊也看不出什麼異常，可能還是外部原因。等小格勞回來再說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "小深靛，不用再施術了，來休息一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "小深靛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我還是比較習慣有一點光亮的環境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "光亮能給人希望，老師是這麼告訴我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "以前看守燈塔的時候，我和老師也會儘量讓燈火亮的時間長一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "只要你別太累就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "都說了是小菜一碟啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "說起停電......以前我在維多利亞上學的時候，也有過在晚上遭遇停電的經歷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "一定很不方便吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "對一心學習的同學來說確實是這樣啦，所以他們會點起蠟燭讀書。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不過對大多數同學來說，停電了就跟放假沒什麼兩樣，大家會開始閒聊什麼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "坐在燭光裡和同學聊天，分享偷偷帶進教室的零食......現在的感覺和那時有點像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "那......需要我把光滅掉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "那倒不必啦，如果沒有蠟燭，教室裡一片漆黑，大家也高興不起來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "我去問過了，只是短時間的供電不穩，馬上就好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "——好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我們也不在這多打擾了，點心就留給你們。我們先回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "感謝二位！任何時候，如果需要理髮，都請到我這裡來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我替小格勞答應你啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "我自己還是算了。雖然機率很低，但和我發生身體接觸還是有一定的危險性，我不得不注意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "原來是這樣啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "那我們先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "好的！等飲料喝完，我把杯子洗好，給你們送過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "多謝，送到我宿舍就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我之前只知道藍毒小姐是用毒高手，從來不知道她這麼和善。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "嗯，藍毒一直很和善的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "不過，一開始的時候，她不知道我是敵是友，一度把弩箭架在我脖子上來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "欸？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "其實也沒什麼，問清楚之後她就把弩箭拿開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "而且她隨口問了個問題就判斷出我是伊比利亞人，還給我解釋了我和別人之間發生的誤會，說那些人把我當成了賞金獵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "（聽起來有點怪怪的......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我吃好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "嗯，我也差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我們接著進行下一步吧，我幫你塗養護液——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "深靛小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "澄、澄閃，我問你一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "好的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "剛剛藍毒讓你喝的飲料，是、是什麼顏色的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "讓我想想......她說的是“玫紅色”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "欸，你的飲料是淡紫色的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "淡紫色的是什麼口味，我能嘗嘗嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "別，別碰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "那個是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "（不行，不行，不能跟她解釋那個飲料的事。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "（她好不容易才建立起對藍毒的好印象。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "那個是......格勞克斯的飲料。剛剛光照不夠，我看錯顏色了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "所以你和她拿錯飲料了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "沒錯，就是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "你看起來暈乎乎的——難道格勞克斯小姐的飲料是含酒精的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "那倒不是......不過也差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "你臉色看起來不太好。要休息一會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "嗯，好的，我去休息一會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "正好，我趁這個機會收拾一下托盤和杯子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "不、不、不行，不要碰格勞克斯的飲料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "欸？為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "（這......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我、我去刷杯子吧。我自己的......飲料杯，我自己、自己刷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "可你看起來真的不太舒服......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不用勉強自己的，我去刷杯子就好，你好好休息一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "等等，等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "欸，深靛小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咕嘟咕嘟咕嘟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "......把半杯飲料都喝掉了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我......失陪一下，我去一趟醫療、醫療......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "醫療部？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "沒錯，我去、一趟、醫療部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "這個杯子你先不要、不要、不要碰，等我......回來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "你看起來真的很不舒服，我陪你一起去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "不、用，我沒事......你在這裡......等我......我一會回來還要、還要護理那個那個那個、頭髮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深靛站起身來，像喝得酩酊大醉一樣，東倒西歪地走出了房間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "深靛小姐到底是怎麼了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "難道她是對格勞克斯小姐飲料裡面的東西過敏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不行，我得去看看她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "澄閃小姐？小深靛呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "藍毒小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "她剛剛說要去醫療部，搖搖晃晃地出去了。我很擔心她，她是不是出什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "你是說她一個人搖搖晃晃地走出去了？她沒昏過去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "沒有......雖然我確實有點擔心她會不會倒在半路上，她看起來像是喝醉了一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "（安心的嘆氣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "她喝剩的飲料呢？我來把飲料處理掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "是說淡紫色那個嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_326_glacus_1",
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "她喝了半杯，看起來就不太舒服。我想去把飲料倒掉，把杯子刷乾淨，她卻說什麼也不讓我去，最後直接把飲料喝乾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒&格勞克斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "她喝了一整杯，然後還搖搖晃晃地自己走出了這個房間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄閃",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "是這樣沒錯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "該說她什麼好呢......成長迅速嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "（苦笑）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "那杯飲料裡的東西也不是特別烈性的那種，她只要出得了這個門就到得了醫療部，到了醫療部就不用擔心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "藍毒",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_129_bluep_1",
      "text": "格勞克斯，保險起見，你還是去醫療部看看深靛——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "請問藍毒幹員和格勞克斯幹員在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "感覺好些了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "好多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "藍毒的解毒劑起效真快啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "當然，你被毒倒了這麼多次，對毒藥的抗性也越來越強了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "說起來，藍毒一向很有分寸的，這次你攝入的毒素的量卻比平常多好多。怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "因為我搞錯了，把格勞克斯的飲料喝了下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "格勞克斯干員？我記得她幾乎可以說是百毒不侵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "是的，所以藍毒給她調製的飲料裡面，會放一些對常人來說有毒的東西。但對格勞克斯來說，那不過是口味新奇的提神佐料罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "就好像咖啡對一些動物有毒那樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "如果喝掉飲料的不是我，而是其他幹員，症狀還要強烈很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "一般人也不會去喝格勞克斯幹員的飲料的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "還要水嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "嗯......我隱約記得，來醫療部的路上，我遇到了什麼人，那個人把我送了過來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "是艾麗妮幹員。她把你送了過來，然後就走掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "艾麗妮，艾麗妮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "——審判官？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "沒錯，就是那位年紀很輕的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我出去一趟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "你剛剛恢復過來，不適合劇烈運動——你到底要去哪裡呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "呼、呼、呼......還是有點暈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "不行，我得趕快——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "艾麗妮小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "你恢復得很快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "確實，我對毒物的抗性稍高一些——不對，我不是要說這個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "艾麗妮小姐，請千萬不要怪罪藍毒和格勞克斯她們，她們不是故意的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "（嘆氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "是我自己誤喝了格勞克斯的飲料，責任全都在我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "（更重地嘆氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "深靛幹員，我推薦你回到醫療部再休息一會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "為......為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "因為你的神志好像還是不太清醒。你顯然把我的形象和某些被人歪曲的審判官形象重合在一起了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "她們剛剛把事情都告訴我了。你喝了格勞克斯幹員的飲料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "由於格勞克斯幹員對毒劑的抗性，那個飲料對她來說有提神作用，但對其他人來說只是碰一碰都會中毒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "還有那位一直劈裡啪啦響個不停的小理髮師在一旁做證，我可以確信，這確實只是一起不幸的小事故。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "所以......所以她們安然無恙，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "我現在是羅德島的一名幹員。就算她們真的故意下毒害你，我也不可能自作主張，當場對她們做什麼出格的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "對於既是羅德島幹員又是伊比利亞人的你來說，這總該想得到吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "對、對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "沒關係，你能明白就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "好啦，你剛剛中了毒，趕緊去休息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "好的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "還有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "艾麗妮小姐的嘴角......有湖藍色的蛋糕碎屑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "這個......調查事件的真相也是工作的一環，就算這意味著以身犯險......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "（小聲）......至少在嘗第一塊的時候，我是這麼想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "（小聲）當然，那位小理髮師拼盡全力，差一點就聲淚俱下的推薦也很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "原來是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "這麼說你可能會不高興，但你和我以前見過的其他審判官......確實不太一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我所知的伊比利亞審判官，就算知道某個阿戈爾人清白無辜，也絕不會和那個人多發生一丁點接觸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "我承認，在這一點上我稍微特殊一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "不過，如果真的有邪惡藏身於此，我也絕不會手下留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "你呢，深靛幹員？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "不論是作為羅德島幹員也好，還是作為伊比利亞人也好，我想聽聽你對這些事的看法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "我沒想那麼多。我只知道藍毒和格勞克斯是我的朋友，我不想讓朋友因為我蒙受冤屈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "我喜歡你的回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "text": "再見，深靛幹員，和你聊天很愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "再見，艾麗妮小姐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "等等，這股香味......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "speakerId": "avgnew_469_indigo_1",
      "text": "澄閃也給你推薦了同一款髮膜嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "aliases": [
        "醫療幹員"
      ]
